{"2984800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Double Whammy", "steam_appid": 2984800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a Guitar Shop - Fix guitars, clean the shop, and deal with demanding customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Guitar Designer - Shape and paint custom guitars from scratch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person Guitar Action - Battle monsters in fast-paced, intense dream missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real Guitar Mini Game - Plug in a real guitar and play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/extras/b2c6d51e8bed9dc446f35a3253fdddf5.poster.avif?t=1788285152\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/extras/b2c6d51e8bed9dc446f35a3253fdddf5.webm?t=1788285152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/extras/b2c6d51e8bed9dc446f35a3253fdddf5.mp4?t=1788285152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Double Whammy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Double Whammy</strong> is a genre-bending shop-management / action game that follows Gigi, an aspiring guitarist, as she balances her day job at a guitar shop with nightly battles in the dream realm. 🎸🎸</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/extras/878619de9d998a06bce56c8fb301008a.poster.avif?t=1788285152\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/extras/878619de9d998a06bce56c8fb301008a.webm?t=1788285152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/extras/878619de9d998a06bce56c8fb301008a.mp4?t=1788285152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After discovering an old guitar instruction book, Gigi opens a portal to the dream realm filled with otherworldly threats. Although each night's trial ends at sunrise, her guitars remain damaged in real life. To survive the next battle, she must work at the guitar shop to repair her broken guitars and acquire new gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/extras/ba805bebbb4d46f21f7e62f0135b010b.poster.avif?t=1788285152\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/extras/ba805bebbb4d46f21f7e62f0135b010b.webm?t=1788285152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/extras/ba805bebbb4d46f21f7e62f0135b010b.mp4?t=1788285152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Six-String Playground</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design wild custom guitars from scratch - shape them, paint them, and take them into battle or jam with them in the rhythm game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune, polish, and repair guitars in mini-games at the guitar shop. Serve customers, earn money, and prepare your guitar loadout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night time, grab your favorite guitar and dive into fast-paced dream realm combat. Smash and shred through monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/extras/7433508a2b6f9bb41ecaefb645333e12.poster.avif?t=1788285152\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/extras/7433508a2b6f9bb41ecaefb645333e12.webm?t=1788285152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/extras/7433508a2b6f9bb41ecaefb645333e12.mp4?t=1788285152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/extras/6d4aea1c5b96b051a8f76ac72f193b58.poster.avif?t=1788285152\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/extras/6d4aea1c5b96b051a8f76ac72f193b58.webm?t=1788285152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/extras/6d4aea1c5b96b051a8f76ac72f193b58.mp4?t=1788285152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a Guitar Shop - Fix guitars, clean the shop, and deal with demanding customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Guitar Designer - Shape and paint custom guitars from scratch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person Guitar Action - Battle monsters in fast-paced, intense dream missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real Guitar Mini Game - Plug in a real guitar and play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragra